xt sue  richard alias the invisible woman of the  fantastic four if the next reboot is  ever to be produced for scarlett  johansson it came at the perfect time  because even though the american actress  was no longer an unknown actress  the role of black widow took her to a  whole new level  with the role of jack sparrow a pardon  me of course i mean captain jack sparrow  johnny depp managed to successfully  portray a character that probably could  not be cast with  anyone else today funny when you  consider that the role of the pirate was  actually meant for someone else  namely none other than comedy star jim  carrey he was indeed favored by director  gore rubinski  in the end kerry reluctantly had to turn  it down because he had already signed on  for the role of bruce in the eponymous  film bruce  almighty although the quality of the  pirates of the caribbean movies has  certainly declined  depp was still the right choice in  retrospect don't you think  while there are some films that were a  huge success as a result of great acting  there are also productions that flopped  at the box office left us wondering  whether it would have been better with a  different lead actor  one example is the science fiction film  jupiter is sending it's dark mila kunis  is jupiter jones and channing tatum  as kane wise greatly announced the movie  is now considered as one of the major  flops of the last 10  years especially the main actor seemed  rather flat in the science fiction opera  of the matrix makers it is interesting  to note that shortly before shooting  began  natalie portman was being considered for  the role of jupiter jones and joseph  gordon-levitt was also expected to play  the leading role  however both cancelled whether the weak  leading roles are attributable to the  acting performances of kunis and tandem  or rather the script  is up to debate  another title we had hide hopes for was  the video game adaption prince of persia  the sense of time from 2010  in the film of the same name adoptive  prince dazed and played by jack  gyllenhaal  must protect the dagger that contains  this sense of time from  sheikh amar and his power hungry brother  nizam unfortunately like most game  adaptions the film did not live up to  the expectations of fans and critics  earning only 90 million dollars at the  american box office  what's interesting to know is that  gyllenhaal and his acting colleague  gemma arden who plays  princess tamina were not the desired  casts while dashing was supposed to be  played by charlie clawson tamina was  meant to be portrayed by the iranian  actress  goshiti farahani however her role in  ridley scott's body of lies got her  arrested at the airport and she wasn't  allowed to leave iran for 6 months  which is why arthelene got the role once  again though we don't want to put the  blame completely on the actors  it's always a challenge for directors to  fit such an elaborate game into a  hollywood movie and sadly they usually  make sacrifices that ruin the experience  for fans  which casting choice surprised you the  most and can you think of any roles that  would have been better cast  differently let us know in the comments  we hope you enjoyed our selection  if you don't want to miss any future  videos well you know what to do  until then take care  [Music]

